# Bare-metal Monitoring Agent - Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env and update with host-specific values, then run install.sh
#
# Unlike monitoring-edge this stack is NOT deployed via Portainer - it installs
# natively on the hypervisor with systemd units.

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Core configuration (required)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Unique identifier for this host. Appears in metrics & logs as the `host` label.
# Must not collide with any monitoring-edge HOSTNAME.
HOSTNAME=supermicro

# Central monitoring endpoints (same values as the Docker edge hosts use)
CENTRAL_PROMETHEUS_URL=https://monitoring.example.com/prometheus/api/v1/write
CENTRAL_LOKI_URL=https://monitoring.example.com/loki/api/v1/push
BASIC_AUTH_USER=remote
BASIC_AUTH_PASSWORD=your-password-here

# Leave CENTRAL_LOKI_URL empty to skip promtail entirely (metrics only).

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional: Proxmox VE API metrics
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Address of the PVE node whose API should be scraped. Leave empty to disable -
# the scrape job self-drops via the regex '^$' relabel rule.
# PVE_API_HOST=127.0.0.1

# API token. Create it on the PVE host first:
#   pveum user add prometheus@pve
#   pveum aclmod / -user prometheus@pve -role PVEAuditor
#   pveum user token add prometheus@pve monitoring --privsep 0
# PVE_TOKEN_USER=prometheus@pve
# PVE_TOKEN_NAME=monitoring
# PVE_TOKEN_VALUE=xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx

# Where the exporter itself listens. Default is fine.
# PVE_EXPORTER_TARGET=localhost:9221

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional: SMART metrics
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The BMC does not expose drive temperatures on this board (M2_SSD1 Temp reads
# "No Reading"), so SMART is the only source for SSD/NVMe health.
# Install smartctl_exporter separately, then point at it:
# SMARTCTL_EXPORTER_TARGET=localhost:9633

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Notes
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# - Power draw is NOT collected. Supermicro X12SDV in a CSE-505 chassis has no
#   PMBus PSU: DCMI activation fails with 0xd5 and Intel Node Manager returns
#   0xc1. Measure at the wall instead and push that series in separately.
# - The IPMI scrape interval is pinned to 30s in agent.yml.template. Do not
#   lower it to match the 5s used by monitoring-edge; the BMC will time out.
